        "3709": {"synopsis":"Sums the 512 bytes of the directory sector buffer at HL in bank B, if sector DE is in the\nchecked part of the directory (the count of records at (IX+$0B), bit 7 off).\nExit: carry set if the sector is not checked; otherwise carry clear, A = the sum (Z if 0)\nand HL = the sector's byte in the table of sums at (IX+$26).\nChanges: AF, HL."},
