        "4169": {"synopsis":"For entry E, looks at the fourth entry of its group of four, counting from HL in 32-byte\nsteps: if that one's byte 0 is $21, points HL at the 10 bytes for entry E in it (byte 1 + 10\n* (E mod 4)) and sets Z; otherwise NZ.\nEntry: HL = the entry, E = its number.\nChanges: AF, BC, HL.","comment":"Entry within its group of 4"},
